{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/497cee15db030735d54589fed9600f05.avif?t=1769107091\" alt=\"Welcome to Tonbrook!\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tonbrook is a cozy life sim mixed with the adventure and wonder of a Dungeons and Dragons game.\u00a0 You play a character of your own making who receives an invitation to attend the Daverton Adventurer's Academy, well-known for producing some of the greatest sellswords in all of the Erreban Penninsula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.poster.avif?t=1769107091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.webm?t=1769107091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.mp4?t=1769107091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pay for schooling by going on missions that various clients hire the Academy for, and the rest of time you can spend studying, exploring, and forming relationships with the other students.\u00a0 You can also enrich your wallet by looting, farming, fishing,  waiting tables, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/0993960251b82b60c934041ba0924ed4.avif?t=1769107091\" alt=\"Featuring:\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large open world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of characters with relationship mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different skills to level up with study or practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of ways to make money: fishing, farming, running a factory, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story with rich lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, party-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creation and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931490?t=1769107091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/2485dd557d69f6775bfae0f5390a111684f66238/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769107091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/fb41adb0a03a543a17c025af25489f04c4073236/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769107091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/fb41adb0a03a543a17c025af25489f04c4073236/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769107091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4035020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s