evel up with study or practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of ways to make money: fishing, farming, running a factory, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story with rich lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, party-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creation and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sapient Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/909f81ed3d59e9fa294e1e6cf045e2ca52aa317b/header.jpg?t=1769107091","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3931490/373425322/d70e49d582b9c5bd9c994353c3165e6e93c7f5ff/1764803130/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764807894","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3931490/373425322/d70e49d582b9c5bd9c994353c3165e6e93c7f5ff/1764803130/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764807894","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3931490/373425322/d70e49d582b9c5bd9c994353c3165e6e93c7f5ff/1764803130/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764807894","id":257178686,"name":"Tales of Tonbrook Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178686/cb1833aa77dd963275cfbab4a1e8f9f7a8a17ecd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764807894"}],"name":"Tales of Tonbrook","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 640x400<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 365 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sapient